{"id": "md-001", "ops": [{"op": "add", "name": "likes-pool", "type": "semantic", "content": "要带泳池", "salience": 0.6, "sourceRuns": [1]}, {"op": "add", "name": "likes-pool", "type": "semantic", "content": "要带泳池", "salience": 0.4, "sourceRuns": [2], "mergedFrom": ["x"]}], "expect": {"survivors": ["likes-pool"], "salience": {"likes-pool": 0.6}, "fields": {"likes-pool": {"sourceRuns": [1, 2], "mergedFrom": ["x"]}}}, "why": "同名+同内容 = 同一条记忆被重复确认 → salience 取 max(0.6)、血缘取并集", "meta": {"source": "human", "verified": true}}
{"id": "md-002", "ops": [{"op": "add", "name": "pool-pref", "type": "semantic", "content": "要带泳池", "salience": 0.9}, {"op": "add", "name": "pool-pref", "type": "semantic", "content": "不要泳池了,改看无泳池的", "salience": 0.4}], "expect": {"survivors": ["pool-pref"], "salience": {"pool-pref": 0.4}, "content_contains": {"pool-pref": "不要泳池"}}, "why": "同名+内容改变 = 偏好反转 → 新值替换旧值,salience 跟随【新内容】而非取 max。取 max 会把一个过时的高分挂在新内容上", "meta": {"source": "human", "verified": true, "note": "conflict resolution: same-name contradiction, recency wins"}}
{"id": "md-003", "ops": [{"op": "add", "name": "stale", "type": "semantic", "content": "c", "salience": 0.2}, {"op": "age", "name": "stale", "days": 400}, {"op": "compact", "minScore": 0.08}], "expect": {"survivors": [], "removed": ["stale"]}, "why": "低 salience + 长期未用 → compScore 跌破 0.08 → 衰减淘汰", "meta": {"source": "human", "verified": true}}
{"id": "md-004", "ops": [{"op": "add", "name": "a", "type": "semantic", "content": "c", "salience": 0.9}, {"op": "add", "name": "b", "type": "semantic", "content": "c", "salience": 0.6}, {"op": "add", "name": "c", "type": "semantic", "content": "c", "salience": 0.3}, {"op": "compact", "maxSemantic": 2}], "expect": {"survivors": ["a", "b"], "removed": ["c"]}, "why": "超容量 → 按 compScore 留 top-N,最低分被淘汰", "meta": {"source": "human", "verified": true}}
{"id": "md-005", "ops": [{"op": "add", "name": "a", "type": "semantic", "content": "c", "salience": 0.9}, {"op": "add", "name": "b", "type": "semantic", "content": "c", "salience": 0.6}, {"op": "add", "name": "c", "type": "episodic", "content": "c", "salience": 0.5}, {"op": "compact", "maxSemantic": 1, "maxEpisodic": 1}], "expect": {"survivors": ["a", "c"], "removed": ["b"], "idempotent": true}, "why": "两个类型各自独立限额;并断言【压缩是幂等的】——连跑两次结果必须相同,否则每次整理都会继续啃掉记忆", "meta": {"source": "human", "verified": true, "note": "idempotency"}}
{"id": "md-006", "ops": [{"op": "add", "name": "high", "type": "semantic", "content": "c", "salience": 0.8}, {"op": "add", "name": "low", "type": "semantic", "content": "c", "salience": 0.2}], "expect": {"score_order": ["high", "low"]}, "why": "信号活性探针①:只有 salience 不同 → compScore 必须跟着 salience 排序", "meta": {"source": "human", "verified": true, "note": "signal liveness: salience"}}
{"id": "md-007", "ops": [{"op": "add", "name": "fresh", "type": "semantic", "content": "c", "salience": 0.5}, {"op": "add", "name": "old", "type": "semantic", "content": "c", "salience": 0.5}, {"op": "age", "name": "old", "days": 365}], "expect": {"score_order": ["fresh", "old"]}, "why": "信号活性探针②:只有新鲜度不同 → recency 必须生效。若这条失败说明 recency 是死信号", "meta": {"source": "human", "verified": true, "note": "signal liveness: recency"}}
{"id": "md-008", "ops": [{"op": "add", "name": "used", "type": "semantic", "content": "c", "salience": 0.5}, {"op": "add", "name": "unused", "type": "semantic", "content": "c", "salience": 0.5}, {"op": "touch", "name": "used", "times": 20}], "expect": {"score_order": ["used", "unused"]}, "why": "信号活性探针③:只有 useCount 不同 → frequency 必须生效。记忆里曾有过一个 confidence 死字段(从不被 compScore 消费),这类探针就是为了自动发现同类问题", "meta": {"source": "human", "verified": true, "note": "signal liveness: frequency"}}
{"id": "md-009", "ops": [{"op": "add", "name": "wants-pool", "type": "semantic", "content": "买家坚持要带泳池", "salience": 0.7, "slots": {"pool": true}}, {"op": "add", "name": "no-pool-please", "type": "semantic", "content": "买家明确说不要泳池", "salience": 0.7, "slots": {"pool": false}}, {"op": "compact"}], "expect": {"survivors": ["wants-pool", "no-pool-please"], "conflicts": [{"type": "semantic", "field": "pool"}], "derived_filter": {}}, "why": "异名语义矛盾:两条内容相反、名字不同。确定性层现在能发现了——比的是各自【声明的 slots】(pool:true vs pool:false),与名字无关,也不碰散文(解析散文在这一对上正好会出反向结果)。断言分两半:①冲突被检测到 ②该字段【不再进入任何检索】(derived_filter 为空)。两条记忆都保留:靠启发式删掉一条不是确定性层该做的决定,交给能读会话的整理子智能体。", "meta": {"source": "human", "verified": true, "note": "conflict resolution: cross-name contradiction via declared slots"}}
{"id": "md-010", "ops": [{"op": "add", "name": "a", "type": "semantic", "content": "c", "salience": 0.5}, {"op": "add", "name": "b", "type": "semantic", "content": "c", "salience": 0.5}, {"op": "touch", "name": "b", "times": 30}], "expect": {"score_order": ["b", "a"], "rank_order_differs": true}, "why": "【设计不一致探针】compScore(压缩用)= salience×recency×frequency,而 rank(选择降级用)= salience×recency,不含 frequency。所以同一批记忆在【压缩】和【无 LLM 选择】下排序可能不同。断言这个差异存在,以免它被当成 bug 反复发现——但它值得记一笔:被频繁用到的记忆在降级选择里得不到加分", "meta": {"source": "human", "verified": true, "note": "documented inconsistency: rank() omits frequency"}}
{"id": "md-012", "ops": [{"op": "add", "name": "no-pool-pref", "type": "semantic", "content": "不要泳池", "salience": 0.6, "slots": {"pool": false}}, {"op": "add", "name": "saw-pool-house", "type": "episodic", "content": "上周看过一套带泳池的", "salience": 0.5, "slots": {"pool": true}}], "expect": {"survivors": ["no-pool-pref", "saw-pool-house"], "conflicts": [], "derived_filter": {"pool": false}}, "why": "【作用域负对照】跨类型不是矛盾:语义说的是【当前要求】,情景记的是【发生过什么】。'看过带泳池那套'不否定'不要泳池'。断言 ①不报冲突 ②语义那条照常生效(pool:false)——如果检测器忘了按类型分组,这条会因为误报冲突而让 pool 静默,立刻被抓到。", "meta": {"source": "human", "verified": true, "note": "scoping: cross-TYPE is not a contradiction"}}
{"id": "md-013", "ops": [{"op": "add", "name": "viewed-canterbury", "type": "episodic", "content": "看过 Canterbury 那套 3 居", "salience": 0.6, "sourceRuns": [1]}, {"op": "add", "name": "viewed-canterbury", "type": "episodic", "content": "看过 Canterbury 那套 3 居", "salience": 0.4, "sourceRuns": [2], "mergedFrom": ["x"]}], "expect": {"survivors": ["viewed-canterbury"], "salience": {"viewed-canterbury": 0.6}, "fields": {"viewed-canterbury": {"sourceRuns": [1, 2], "mergedFrom": ["x"]}}, "types": {"viewed-canterbury": "episodic"}}, "why": "情景记忆的【合并】:同名+同内容 = 同一件事被重复提到 → salience 取 max(0.6)、血缘取并集。这是 md-001 的情景版。合并只按名字匹配,所以【本该】与类型无关——这条把'与类型无关'变成被断言的事实,而不是一个假设:哪天有人给语义加了特例,这条会失败。", "meta": {"source": "human", "verified": true, "note": "episodic merge (mirror of md-001)"}}
{"id": "md-014", "ops": [{"op": "add", "name": "canterbury-take", "type": "episodic", "content": "看过 Canterbury 那套,很喜欢", "salience": 0.9}, {"op": "add", "name": "canterbury-take", "type": "episodic", "content": "又去看了一次,觉得太贵了", "salience": 0.4}], "expect": {"survivors": ["canterbury-take"], "salience": {"canterbury-take": 0.4}, "content_contains": {"canterbury-take": "太贵"}, "types": {"canterbury-take": "episodic"}}, "why": "情景记忆的【冲突】:同名+内容变了 = 对同一件事的看法翻转 → 新内容替换旧内容,salience 跟随【新内容】(0.4)而不是取 max。这是 md-002 的情景版,理由相同:取 max 会把'很喜欢'时的高分挂到'觉得太贵'上面去。", "meta": {"source": "human", "verified": true, "note": "episodic conflict, same name (mirror of md-002)"}}
{"id": "md-015", "ops": [{"op": "add", "name": "saw-3bed", "type": "episodic", "content": "看过一套 3 居", "salience": 0.6, "slots": {"beds": 3}}, {"op": "add", "name": "saw-4bed", "type": "episodic", "content": "看过一套 4 居", "salience": 0.6, "slots": {"beds": 4}}], "expect": {"survivors": ["saw-3bed", "saw-4bed"], "conflicts": [{"type": "episodic", "field": "beds"}], "derived_filter": {}}, "why": "两条【情景】声明了同一字段的不同值 → 按类型分组后确实报为 episodic 冲突,但 derived_filter 不受影响(情景本来就不进这条通道)。这条钉的是两件事:①检测按类型分组而不是一锅端 ②情景的冲突不会污染检索。顺带说明为什么它仍值得报:两条'看过不同房子'其实不是矛盾而是两件事,报出来是给整理子智能体的信号——它该考虑这两条是不是该合并成一条偏好。", "meta": {"source": "human", "verified": true, "note": "episodic slot conflict is detected but never seeds a filter"}}
{"id": "md-016", "ops": [{"op": "add", "name": "old-viewing", "type": "episodic", "content": "很久以前看过一套", "salience": 0.1}, {"op": "add", "name": "recent-viewing", "type": "episodic", "content": "最近看过一套", "salience": 0.6}, {"op": "age", "name": "old-viewing", "days": 400}, {"op": "compact", "minScore": 0.08}], "expect": {"survivors": ["recent-viewing"], "removed": ["old-viewing"]}, "why": "情景记忆【自身的侵蚀】:低 salience + 放了 400 天 → compScore 跌破 minScore 被淘汰,而同类型的新鲜那条留下。之前压缩只测过按容量淘汰(md-003/004)和分类型限额(md-005),没测过【分数下限】这条路径在情景上生效——两条路是 compactMemories 里独立的两个条件。", "meta": {"source": "human", "verified": true, "note": "episodic erosion via minScore (not the capacity path)"}}
